{
  "title": "Vegan Protein Chocolate Bar (20% Protein)",
  "justification_summary": "The formulation uses only ingredients from the validated candidate set, all of which are permitted and vegan. Pea protein isolate provides the required protein density (\u224820.3% protein in the final bar), while soluble corn fiber and MCT powder contribute fiber and healthy fats, respectively. The total protein content meets the minimum 20% requirement, and the ingredient percentages sum to exactly 100.0000%. No excluded animal-derived ingredients are present, satisfying the hard constraints for a vegan confectionery chocolate bar.",
