  "process_recommendations": [
    "Blend all dry ingredients (sea salt, monk fruit, MCT powder, pea protein, soluble corn fiber, polysorbate 80, chocolate flavor) in a dry mixer at low speed for 5 minutes to prevent clumping.",
    "Gradually add a small amount of plant\u2011based liquid (e.g., oat milk) while mixing to form a cohesive dough; knead until homogeneous.",
    "Shape the dough into bars, place on parchment, chill at 4\u202f\u00b0C for 2\u202fhours to set, then package in moisture\u2011barrier film and store at 25\u202f\u00b0C."
  ],
